    "faq": {
      "badge": "FAQ",
      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "subtitle": "Everything you need to know about AquaRO. Can't find your answer? Reach out to our team.",
      "q1": "How does the free trial work?",
      "a1": "You get full access to all Professional plan features for 14 days, no credit card required. At the end of the trial, choose a plan that fits your needs or your account will be paused.",
      "q2": "Can I monitor multiple RO units from a single dashboard?",
      "a2": "Absolutely. AquaRO is built for multi-unit, multi-station operations. You can monitor hundreds of RO units across unlimited geographic stations from a single unified dashboard.",
      "q3": "How do operators submit readings?",
      "a3": "Operators can submit readings through our mobile-friendly web interface. They log in, select their assigned unit, and input the daily parameters. The system validates the data in real-time against configured thresholds.",
      "q4": "Does AquaRO integrate with automated sensors?",
      "a4": "Yes. Our API supports integration with IoT sensors and automated monitoring equipment for real-time data ingestion without manual operator input.",
      "q5": "How are alert thresholds configured?",
      "a5": "Administrators can configure custom upper and lower thresholds for each parameter (TDS, pressure, pH, conductivity, etc.) per unit or station. When a reading exceeds a threshold, alerts are sent instantly.",
      "q6": "Is my data secure?",
      "a6": "Yes. All data is encrypted at rest and in transit. We use role-based access control to ensure users only see the data they're authorized to access. We perform regular security audits."
    },
